        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ff95e414dea94421b253811201c3e5d9",
      "statement": "A callable passed via tools= is only invoked after the model chooses to call it and cannot rewrite the tool list or prompt before the model call, whereas middleware runs before every model call; caller tools= are additive and never remove a built-in.",
