    {
      "id": "claim_dc5e15e9b04d4be4a701c5c9090157ed",
      "statement": "Tail middleware is ordered late because it reacts to the near-final request: harness-profile extras precede prompt caching, and MemoryMiddleware is placed after prompt caching so its system-prompt mutations do not invalidate the Anthropic cache prefix.",
      "evidence": [
        {
