    {
      "id": "claim_a876d28a2337472a9bac9779a9329064",
      "statement": "Prompt-caching middleware is appended unconditionally (Anthropic always, plus Bedrock/Fireworks when their integration packages are importable) and no-ops for models it does not apply to, so it can be installed but never fire for a given model.",
