    {
      "id": "claim_567995c299114b2bbf992b5300afb308",
      "statement": "Tool exclusion (_ToolExclusionMiddleware) is appended last so excluded tool names are stripped after all tool-injecting middleware and any caller wrap_model_call has run and cannot be restored.",
